Package: propsens
Type: Package
Title: Propensity Model Sensitivity Diagnostics for Matched Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Mostafa M.", family = "Abbas",
                  email = "mostafa.mn.abbas@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Outcome-free diagnostics that measure how much a matched study
    depends on the choice of propensity model. Logistic regression, Bayesian
    additive regression trees and a generalized random forest are each used
    for 1:1 nearest-neighbour matching with cross-fitted scores; the package
    reports study-level rank disagreement, bootstrap rank instability of the
    logistic model and balance spread across models, applies a quality gate,
    and reads an existing 'MatchIt' object directly.
